    "en": "A beaver with orange iron teeth and a red squirrel that stores thousands of cones. Real facts for kids about the animals behind Friendship Bridge."
  },
  "intro": {
    "en": "Venny the beaver and Sammy the squirrel live by a river in the woods. Here's how real beavers and red squirrels live."
  },
